\c 9
\s1 The Destruction of Israel
\p \v 1 \w I saw|strong="H07200"\w* \w the Lord|strong="H00136"\w* \w standing|strong="H05324"\w* \w beside|strong="H05921"\w* \w the altar|strong="H04196"\w*, \w and He said|strong="H00559"\w*:
